    {
     "n": 2,
     "code": "# The pen is currently resting across the holder rim (misidentified as red_mug or pen).\n# To place a pen upright, grasp it near one end or re-orient it.\n# Look at free gripper orientation / placing upright into a cup holder:\n# Wait, let's observe what is on the scene:\nobs = observe()\nholder = obs[\"zones\"][\"magenta_holder\"]\ntable_z = obs[\"table_z\"]\n\n# The object across the holder is detected as \"red_mug\" (or red_pen)\ntarget_name = \"red_pen\" if \"red_pen\" in obs[\"objects\"] else \"red_mug\"\ncandidates = grasp_candidates(target_name)\nchosen = next(c for c in candidates if c[\"fits_open_fingers\"])\n\n# Grasp the pen\ngrasp(chosen)\n\n# To place the pen upright into the holder, orient the gripper so the pen is vertical:\n# The pen was grasped horizontally across its short side.\n# In the gripper frame: fingers point along approach [0,0,-1], finger_axis is along squeezing direction.\n# The long axis of the pen lies along 'side' = approach x finger_axis.\n# If approach is tilted horizontally (e.g. [1, 0, 0] or [0, 1, 0]), the pen can point vertically!\n# But let's check move_gripper with approach:\n# When approach = [0, 1, 0] and finger_axis = [0, 0, 1], side = approach x finger_axis = [1, 0, 0] (horizontal).\n# When finger_axis = [1, 0, 0], approach = [0, 1, 0], side = [0, -0, -1] -> side is along Z (vertical)!\n# That makes the pen's long axis vertical!\n\n# Lift safely first\ncarry_to(holder[\"center\"][0], holder[\"center\"][1] + 0.1, height=0.25)\n\n# Tilt the gripper so the pen becomes vertical:\n# approach = [0, 1, 0] (pointing along +y)\n# finger_axis = [1, 0, 0] (squeezing along x)\n# then side = approach x finger_axis = [0, 0, -1] -> the pen points straight down!\nhx, hy = holder[\"center\"][0], holder[\"center\"][1]\nhz = table_z + holder[\"rim_height\"] + 0.12\n\n# Move above the holder with the pen vertical\nmove_gripper(hx, hy - 0.05, hz, approach=[0, 1, 0], finger_axis=[1, 0, 0], path=\"joint\")\n\n# Move directly over and lower into the holder\nmove_gripper(hx, hy - 0.05, table_z + holder[\"rim_height\"] + 0.05, approach=[0, 1, 0], finger_axis=[1, 0, 0], path=\"line\")\nopen_gripper()\nretreat(dz=0.15)\ngo_home()\ncheck(\"red_pen\", \"magenta_holder\")",
